Z||000004||danny boy||03-08-2001||05:23 PM||||Goin too fast and expecting the Fiero to handle like the Stealth is what caused the spin.Of course the winter tires didn't help much either.<BR>  I Don't recommend the G/A brakes on the rear only.I also don't recommend mashing the brakes in a turn at 50 mph, no matter what the setup.<BR>Ogre was worried the brakes wouldn't get enough fluid, mine got plenty and then some. ||||reg||1
